            </dd>
          </div>
          <div
            data-parallax-item
            class="grid gap-1 sm:grid-cols-[9rem_1fr]"
          >
            <dt class="text-sm text-text-primary">Knowledge</dt>
            <dd class="text-sm text-text-secondary">
              Search over your own data with RAG and vector storage where needed.
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div
            data-parallax-item
            class="grid gap-1 sm:grid-cols-[9rem_1fr]"
          >
            <dt class="text-sm text-text-primary">Strategy</dt>
            <dd class="text-sm text-text-secondary">
              Working out where AI is worth the effort — and where it is not.
            </dd>
